        },
        "text": "Table of ContentsAlphabet Inc.",
        "text_hash": "2f8c99ac0bba90fcf6bfbc211cf5f2a488da9b5f380b95023f9e4d2c09546ec6",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000402-d479eec1",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[432]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 402,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "22.5pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "shift from Google Network properties to Google Search & other properties. Our TAC rate will continue to be affected by changes in device mix; geographic mix; partner agreement terms; partner mix; the percentage of queries channeled through paid access points; product mix; the relative revenue growth rates of advertising revenues from different channels; and revenue share terms.",
        "text_hash": "d479eec15c4898df20410385a8406cfd911b5451fd46882fc91244928d4350e7",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000403-3020401a",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[433]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 403,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "10pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•We have raised capital through external financing in the form of debt and we may continue to seek debt or other forms of financing in the future to support our capital and operating needs.",
        "text_hash": "3020401a44e8a2ac5b5fb6de1cda560a7f1d4e40de96892e430523698646b39f",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000404-d0d00d96",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[434]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 404,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "In 2025, we raised capital through the issuance of debt and we expect to continue to assess the use of debt and other forms of financing in the future. We expect to continue to enter into finance leases, primarily for data centers. Additionally, in 2025, we provided credit support, such as through backstops and guarantees, to certain infrastructure related counterparties and may continue to provide additional credit support in the future.",
        "text_hash": "d0d00d960252254dce6980a824fe38bf74a4feaa802246213cfd1727dee4d176",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000405-5e561bfb",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[435]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 405,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "10pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•We face an evolving regulatory environment, and we are subject to claims, lawsuits, investigations, and other forms of potential legal liability, which could affect our business practices and financial results.",
        "text_hash": "5e561bfb68d856ff6444857933f4efa078af82ed223997c154746fbfe028a2f4",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000406-024c8bce",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[436]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 406,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_79",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Changes in social, political, economic, tax, and regulatory conditions or in laws and policies governing a wide range of topics and related legal matters, including investigations, lawsuits, and regulatory actions, have resulted in fines and caused us to change our business practices. As the regulatory environment continues to evolve, we may continue to incur fines and we expect increased costs associated with compliance, modifications to our products and services, and limitations on our ability to pursue certain business practices. For additional information, see Part I, Item 1A Risk Factors and Legal Matters in Note 10 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 8 of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.",
        "text_hash": "024c8bce80f564067f61128b6781b73a8f79dda9a2a8bfbdf02d0fc885160a54",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000407-037ac86f",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[438]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 407,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-style": "italic",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Revenues and Monetization Metrics",
        "text_hash": "037ac86fd2513267f60f319306f6362ab38cbe998be7d946a2ebe23fcd16df3d",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000408-11a572f4",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[439]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 408,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "24.75pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "We generate revenues by delivering relevant, cost-effective online advertising; cloud-based solutions that provide enterprise customers of all sizes with infrastructure, platform services, and applications; and sales of other products and services, such as fees received for subscription-based products, apps and in-app purchases, and devices. For additional information on how we recognize revenue, see Note 1 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 8 of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.",
        "text_hash": "11a572f476232d6e9dab9e318cb22b08054311cbca319c7ba6edb5a6bbea216e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000409-80bf09f4",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[440]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 409,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "In addition to the long-term trends and their financial effect on our business discussed above, fluctuations in our revenues have been and may continue to be affected by a combination of factors, including:",
        "text_hash": "80bf09f4ec2c39856a39a06c9fec2b7a1e9a260d1d5be02f67cd0cb2b6bbd935",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000410-da3ab288",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[441]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 410,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•changes in foreign currency exchange rates;",
        "text_hash": "da3ab288e1ab6bbc34b036bb925a1f807610befb3ce5f584ceac8d1e3b106ece",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000411-6e1310cf",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[442]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 411,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•changes in pricing, such as those resulting from changes in fee structures, discounts, and customer incentives;",
        "text_hash": "6e1310cf53978510fe352e7dce7999f19f00a3bd5b6ecbf4ef5d301f58ba3dfa",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000412-9b3b3e1c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[443]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 412,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•general economic conditions and various external dynamics, including geopolitical events, regulations, and other measures and their effect on advertiser, consumer, and enterprise spending;",
        "text_hash": "9b3b3e1c288cb786db56cd1a397519e027334986fa0254bc046cb863a0063c2c",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000413-eb0b52bf",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[444]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 413,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "36pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "-18pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•new product, service, and market launches; and",
        "text_hash": "eb0b52bf3ef712daa3587f677b8e851df9faa06f87a7c764b8c9d567a9e633c5",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000414-33c7f060",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[445]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 414,
        "reported_page": 29,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
